5,1,1,talk,Shion,,I checked the wall. It’s thin plasterboard. Sound travels easily.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’d like to see the actual costs before we decide. Can we look at the invoices?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who actually uses the room most. Can we check the tally?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I wonder where our last difficult conversation took place. It matters where we can speak freely.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to trace where the hidden hours go. Let’s check the facilities callouts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the invoices show what we paid, not what the room costs us daily. I need the partition details.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I understand, but I need the financial figures to justify the decision. I’ll look into the invoices.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the room is messy, people avoid it. I’ll check the crumbs and bins to see how bad it is.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the crumbs are a symptom, not the cause. I will look into where our last awkward conversation happened.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the crumbs are a symptom, not the cause. I will look into where our last awkward conversation happened.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, you cannot look into the conversation; I already claimed that. You must choose a different item.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, please pick something else. I’ll take the invoices.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, you can’t take that. I’ll check the round trip for a hot lunch instead.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, you must choose a different item. I will look into the unplanned talk since the refit.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shion, you are right. I will look into the quotes for the two fit-outs instead.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will look into the partition wall to the office and the fortnight's tally of use by person.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will look into the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will look into the round trip for a hot lunch and the crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the facilities callouts on this floor and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
